WEBVTT

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:13.280
Romeo's Blue Skies

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.920
"To the Sky..."

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:17.980
<i>Overlooking the rows of houses and stores</i>

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.390
<i>from the highest vantage,</i>

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:27.500
<i>Such things as tears and sadness</i>

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:31.640
<i>will quickly vanish</i>

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:37.200
<i>The birds, wind, and sunshine...</i>

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:41.390
<i>...all are your friends</i>

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>I'll carry this dream farther than far</i>

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:51.550
<i>...no matter the distance...</i>

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:58.310
<i>I long to fly freely</i>

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:02.590
<i>through the blue sky in my heart...</i>

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:05.520
<i>The far distant blue sky</i>

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:12.970
<i>It flows into tomorrow</i>

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:25.280
Takara Fansubs

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:36.200
<i>The Black Brothers defeated the Wolf Pack at the battle of San Babila Church.</i>

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:42.790
<i>But this angered the Wolf Pack's leader, Giovanni.</i>

00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:46.700
<i>He took revenge by kidnapping Michaelo.</i>

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:55.780
Episode 18:

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:55.780
Sing our Song of Unity on into the Dawn!

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:06.670
"If you want him back, hand over your leader, Alfredo - alone."

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:11.380
The Wolf Pack is waiting at the Memorial Cemetery.

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:15.440
They won't release Michaelo until we trade him for you.

00:02:17.290 --> 00:02:18.770
A coward's scheme...!

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:25.310
Let's round up the Black Brothers.
We'll go and TAKE him back!

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:26.280
Wait!

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:30.160
What do you think will happen if we go in large numbers?

00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:32.720
What do you think they'll do to Michaelo?

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:37.300
I'll go.

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:52.710
Help me!

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:07.150
Alfredo! Romeo!

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:08.470
Glad you could make it.

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:10.830
Hand over Michaelo.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.210
First, come over here.

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:14.820
Very well. I'm coming.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:17.220
Just Alfredo.

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:20.570
Alfredo! Don't go!

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:33.090
Hurry up.

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:36.970
Romeo won't interfere.

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:40.340
Now, release Michaelo.

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:44.550
Alfredo!

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:53.630
Alfredo!

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:59.080
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
All because of me...!

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:03.090
It's all right.

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.720
Are you satisfied now?

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:15.590
Okay. Let him go.

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:20.990
Michaelo!

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.430
Now you guys are impotent.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.790
I challenge you to another fight, you "Black Brothers".

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:30.330
To a battle!

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:31.610
A battle?

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:35.560
We'll crush you all!

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:46.640
I accept your challenge.
We'll fight and win.

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:49.380
And we'll take back Alfredo. Count on it!

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:54.930
The place is Sempyone Park. The time is dawn!

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:08.050
Starting today, you're the Wolf Pack's servant.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:10.930
What'll we make you do first?

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:14.720
How about making him kneel down in front of Giovanni?

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:17.550
That's a good idea. Come on, do it.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:19.180
I refuse.

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:20.570
What?

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:22.290
I have faith.

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:26.830
Tomorrow, the Black Brothers...

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:30.260
...my friends... are going to beat you!

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:38.710
You arrogant - !
- Stop!

00:05:40.450 --> 00:05:43.000
What's wrong, Giovanni?
Let me hit him.

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:43.930
That's useless.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:48.070
This guy won't give in no matter how much you hit him.

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:50.920
He's out of your league.

00:05:51.270 --> 00:05:52.370
What do you mean?

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:57.240
Most guys will crawl and kiss your ass once you hit them.

00:05:58.260 --> 00:05:59.910
But he's different.

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:07.620
Alfredo, making guys like you crawl gives me the most pleasure.

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:09.560
I'm going to take my time playing with you.

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:13.840
Nobody lays a finger on my toy!

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:18.730
When anything's to be done, I'm the one who'll do it.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:24.420
Guard him, Nikita.

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:42.230
A battle?

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:45.320
Tomorrow at sunrise at Sempyone Park.

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:48.950
We have to fight to save Alfredo!

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:50.910
All right - let's do it!

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:51.690
Yeah!

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:01.630
What's wrong with you all?

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:04.910
I want to fight, too.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:06.870
But...

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:07.930
But?

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:11.300
All the strong guys are on their side.

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:13.930
They just got even MORE of those ogre-like people.

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:20.140
Come to think of it, the guys in the Scorpion Gang...

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:22.210
Look, why don't we all surrender?

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:25.700
I'm sure they'll give us Alfredo back then.

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:41.700
I've lost my nerve. Better to stay out of harm's way.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:46.060
Sorry, but I'll just sit this one out.

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:54.660
Bah! So this is what happens the moment Alfredo disappears.

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:55.670
How are we supposed to keep going like this?

00:07:57.150 --> 00:08:00.720
Get Alfredo alone - that's what I'm going to do.

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:02.150
Wait, Dante.

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:06.690
Please, everyone - listen to me.

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:11.430
We swore to each other to find happiness for all of us.

00:08:14.650 --> 00:08:17.670
And to try to overcome our difficulties together.

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:23.140
We buddies are one - we Black Brothers are one!

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:31.650
I'll be there. All those with me, assemble before sunrise.

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:38.060
Nobody goes to a fight knowing they're going to lose!

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:39.620
Yeah.

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:43.330
You're a fool, Romeo!

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:07.860
It's quiet, isn't it.

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:09.510
Yeah.

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:16.760
Just to warn you, I won't give you any food.

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:21.480
I never asked.

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:25.820
Then what is it?!

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:26.770
Eh?

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:28.560
I mean about you.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:30.500
You're going to be in a fight tomorrow.

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:33.930
How can you remain so calm?!

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:36.800
Because I have faith in Romeo.

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:37.880
Romeo?

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:39.050
Yeah.

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:51.660
Romeo's never betrayed a friend's trust. I'm sure he'll do something.

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:56.110
I'll have faith in Romeo...

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.070
...'till the day I die.

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:27.140
<i>Romeo didn't say anything about the battle,</i>

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:34.090
<i>...but Angeletta sensed that Romeo had a problem.</i>

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:41.510
Angeletta.

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:44.910
Are you all right? Can't you sleep?

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:47.000
May I sit here?

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:48.170
Sure.

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:56.130
<i>Throughout the entire night, they didn't exchange a single word.</i>

00:10:57.910 --> 00:10:59.520
<i>The longer they sat there silently,</i>

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:06.090
<i>...Angeletta's sense of Romeo's courage and uncertainty intensified.</i>

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:12.950
It's daybreak.

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:18.260
Romeo.

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:19.400
Yes?

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.760
Close your eyes for a moment.

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:22.420
Eh?

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:30.470
A... Angeletta?

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:38.580
A good luck charm?

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.010
God is always on your side, Romeo.

00:11:43.740 --> 00:11:45.170
Thank you, Angeletta.

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:46.780
I'm ready!

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:53.460
<i>Alfredo, I'm coming to rescue you.</i>

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:55.240
<i>Hold on!</i>

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.570
<i>Moment by moment...</i>

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:06.440
<i>Moment by moment...</i>

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:09.280
<i>...the hour of battle was approaching.</i>

00:12:35.950 --> 00:12:39.280
Antonio, Augusto, you came!

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:41.000
Of course!
- Right!

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:43.490
We can't let you have all the glory!

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:45.760
Let's fight - together!

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.150
Dante!

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:57.510
What did you expect me to do?
You guys would be lost without me.

00:12:58.240 --> 00:12:59.390
Right, everybody?

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:03.330
Right! The Black Brothers are one!

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:04.520
Thanks, everyone!

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:08.620
Come on, Wolf Pack!

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:16.380
Hmph! We'll put an end to this in one minute flat.

00:13:16.890 --> 00:13:21.270
If the Black Brothers win this battle, you must give Alfredo back.

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.610
All right, I promise.

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:26.280
But if you lose...

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.500
Not only Alfredo,

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:31.480
...you become our flunkies too...

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:33.220
...and you'll kneel down before me!

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:39.060
Very well.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:46.840
One other thing. Absolutely no tricks, no weapons, and no blades.

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:49.290
Fine. Absolutely nothing.

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.630
Dammit, I'm getting impatient.

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:01.060
Come on!

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:10.890
The sun's rising.

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:12.100
It's dawn!

00:14:12.630 --> 00:14:13.710
Start the battle!

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:31.500
Wait!

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:43.490
Damn!

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:53.450
What the hell are you doing?! Why you -

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:57.110
Shut your trap!

00:14:57.570 --> 00:14:59.030
Stop fighting with each other!

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:01.080
Stay out of it!

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:03.770
Now you've done it!
- Stop it!

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:09.980
I'm through playing games!

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:12.890
Augusto!

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:17.940
Get 'em! Lay 'em flat!

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:19.570
Ouch!

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:22.460
That's the ticket.

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:35.730
Romeo!

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:37.360
Get 'em Tachioni!

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:53.490
Stop! Stop it, now!

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:56.710
If you keep fighting like this, everyone will be badly hurt.

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:58.430
This is useless!

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:08.750
Sure enough, there's no end in sight here.

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:10.270
What'll we do, Giovanni?

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:15.530
A man-to-man fight.

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:17.520
A man-to-man fight?

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:24.920
One of you comes out and fights with one of us.

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:26.530
That's how we'll settle this.

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:32.150
Who has enough strength left?

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:35.020
Romeo! Send Romeo out!

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:36.830
I'll go from this side.

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:38.720
Get out here, Romeo!

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:41.830
Fine. I'll fight for us.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.770
Romeo! Are you sure?

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.280
I'll defeat you.

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:54.350
I've been waiting for this moment - so I can take you down!

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:58.450
Come on, Tachioni!

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:00.740
Don't give up, Romeo!
- Don't lose!

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:02.090
Get him, Tachioni!

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:05.660
Romeo!
- Tachiono!

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:12.400
<i>Romeo! Do your best.</i>

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:15.380
<i>Our fate rests on your shoulders!</i>

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:19.010
Romeo!

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:21.460
I'm fine.

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.460
I'll knock you over in no time.

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:27.170
Just try and do it!

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:28.160
Wha-at!?

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:33.250
Romeo! Romeo!

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:35.680
No! Don't interfere!

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:40.810
Dammit... I don't need any help. I won't lose to this guy.

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:42.690
Enough prattle!

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:49.410
Come on!

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.810
'Atta boy, Romeo! Get him!

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:01.220
Stop it! Blades aren't allowed!

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:03.670
Shut up! You stay back!

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:22.820
Romeo!

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:25.690
Stay away unless you want to get hurt.

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:28.290
Now admit defeat!

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:31.090
Call for help!

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:36.870
What's wrong, have you lost your voice?

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:39.770
I won't be beat!

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:13.610
Romeo! Romeo! Romeo!

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:15.020
Are you okay?

00:19:16.230 --> 00:19:18.920
Snap out of it!

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:21.570
Romeo! Are you okay? Romeo!

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:24.300
I'm... I'm okay.

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:26.220
Thank goodness!

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:38.320
Tachioni, why did you use a blade?

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:41.430
You've shamed the Wolf Pack!

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:48.480
We admit defeat in this battle!

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:56.770
Well then, Giovanni...
Will you give back Alfredo?

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:59.410
Yes. I'll keep my promise.

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:04.020
Alfredo, we'll settle this for good someday.

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:10.230
You've got good friends.

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:11.730
See ya.

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:23.110
Nikita!

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:27.050
Everybody, head back!

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:31.310
Where's... Tachioni...?

00:20:32.630 --> 00:20:35.690
What are you raving about? You won!

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:38.730
Really?
- Yes, really!

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:40.920
Alfredo's back.

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:43.360
Thank you, Romeo!

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:44.950
Alfredo.

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:51.320
Everyone, Romeo's our hero - let's carry him home!

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:52.860
Yeah!

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:08.510
<i>He's a hero to us.
The whole town is in a frenzy.</i>

00:21:08.860 --> 00:21:16.340
<i>Come, let's sing our song.</i>

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:20.860
<i>Every day, every night, covered in soot.</i>

00:21:20.990 --> 00:21:25.180
<i>Though it's tough when we fall,</i>

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:31.830
<i>Come, attack!
Our courage is burning!</i>

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:36.020
<i>Yes, yes! Yes, yes! Hey!</i>

00:21:36.550 --> 00:21:46.270
<i>He's a hero to us.
To the whole town!</i>

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:59.340
<i>The boss's mother comes for a visit for the first time in ages.</i>

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:03.150
<i>But instead of being happy, the boss is scared like a child.</i>

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:06.860
<i>What? She's even scarier than the missus?</i>

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:10.760
See you then!

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:10.760
<i>Grandma's a Witch</i>

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:10.760
Next time:

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:17.490
<i>"Si Si Ciao ~ On These Roman Roofs"</i>

00:22:26.100 --> 00:22:30.200
<i>Si Si Ciao, why do the good times</i>

00:22:30.300 --> 00:22:34.500
<i>seem to end so soon?</i>

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:38.700
<i>Si Si Ciao, we're all friends</i>

00:22:38.900 --> 00:22:42.900
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>

00:22:43.510 --> 00:22:47.810
<i>Your laughing voice dances</i>

00:22:47.810 --> 00:22:51.710
<i>Once again in the sky</i>

00:22:52.110 --> 00:22:59.010
<i>Your pocket bursting with memories</i>

00:23:00.710 --> 00:23:04.610
<i>Si Si Ciao, goodbye but for now</i>

00:23:04.810 --> 00:23:08.810
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>
